# A guide to the decisions

**Current destination:** [Three recommended essays and two reserves, October 31](final-shortlist.md). This chapter describes earlier stages; their decisions and counts remain dated below.

The account below describes the earlier stage of the project; the later recommendation is the current state.

These 48 entries map the work through the October 12 retrospective to its chapters. Start with the question that interests you; use the [dated history](timeline.md) to follow the sequence or the [121-topic index](methodology-index.md) for finer detail.

**Later work:** [five post-midterm programs](post-midterm.md) extended the search and reopened six rejected candidates. The [current selection](selection.md) brings 22 candidates into a 22 → 10 → 3 process and explains the correction that returned E086 to the work queue.

